{"event": "start", "id": "1-0", "target": "stage", "file": "changes/2026-11-24-borrowing-retention.cypher", "statement": "// what: delete BORROWED returned before 2024-11-24 of patrons with keepHistory = false\n// why: privacy audit, two-year retention (docs/privacy.md)\n// check: MATCH (p:Patron {keepHistory: false})-[b:BORROWED]->() WHERE b.returnedOn < '2024-11-24' RETURN count(b);\nMATCH (p:Patron {keepHistory: false})\nCALL (p) {\n  MATCH (p)-[b:BORROWED]->(:Item)\n  WHERE b.returnedOn < '2024-11-24'\n  DELETE b\n} IN TRANSACTIONS OF 50 ROWS\n"}
{"event": "end", "id": "1-0", "status": "ok"}
